  "title": "BigHand research highlights client demand for budget transparency and AFAs—and legal finance can help firms deliver",
  "summary": "Recent research from BigHand shows that law firm clients increasingly want alternative fee arrangements (AFAs), signaling a continued shift away from the billable hour. Based on responses from approximately 800 senior legal finance professionals in the US and UK, including for the first time law firm respondents, the survey confirms a trend Burford has long tracked.",
